[4302]="7000794D\n1\tDerrota a los Cerdoespín enfermos (total: 6)\tJabalíes enfermos merodean por las tierras al sur y al este de la puerta de Archet. El condestable Cardoso cree que la mejor forma de acabar con la enfermedad que afecta a los jabalíes locales es eliminar a los ya infectados.\n2\tHabla con Constable Thistlewool\tEl condestable Cardoso se encuentra cerca de las ruinas de la Posada del Tejón Loco en Archet. Querrá saber de tu éxito.\n",
[4303]="70067F91\n1\tKhûtra Elder Ilaya has asked for your help in healing some of the afflicted wild goats surrounding Khûtra. The goats can be found in the hills north of Khûtra.\t\n2\tReturn to Elder Ilaya in Khûtra\tReturn to Elder Ilaya in Khûtra.\n",
[4304]="7002BF96\n1\tDerrota a las sombras (total: 3)\tLas sombras pueden encontrarse en Atburg, al sureste del campamento de Aculf, en Juncal. Bagmund te ha pedido que expulses a las sombras de Atburg y de Juncal.\n2\tHabla con Eowils fuera de Atburg, en Juncal.\tEowils está fuera de Atburg, en Juncal, al sureste del campamento de Aculf. Bagmund te ha pedido que informes de tus éxitos al explorador Eowils.\n",
[4305]="7005AB05\n1\tBurn dwarf bodies (total: 5)\tYou have found dwarf bodies are being used in Angmarim rituals to make wights. You should burn dwarf bodies in Mullach Cagar.\n2\tTalk to Molkha in the valley\tYou have prevented many fallen dwarves from being made into wights. You should return to Molkha in the valley.\n",
[4306]="7002F917\n1\tDerrota a los saqueadores de la Mano Blanca en las Campiñas del Norte (total: 6)\030Derrota a los profanadores de la Mano Blanca (total: 6)\tLas granjas se encuentran en el extremo occidental de las Campiñas del Norte. Cyneswith te ha pedido que derrotes a los saqueadores y profanadores que han invadido y expulsado a los granjeros de sus hogares.\n2\tRegresa con Cyneswith\tCyneswith se encuentra al este, detrás de la gran Finca de Vista Primaveral. Has expulsado a los orcos de las casas y granjas que están al oeste. Este acto debería devolver algo de esperanza a Cyneswith.\n",
[4307]="70058FEE\n1\tTortured Angmarim can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. Múta has asked you to question the Angmarim that have been tortured by the Dourhands and their kin.\t\n2\tTalk to Múta\tMúta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. You have learned what you could from the tortured Angmarim. You should report back to Múta.\n",
[4308]="7006616E\n1\tCollect wood from wood piles (total: 5)\030Collect cloth from banners (total: 5)\tBruidis has asked you to collect wood and cloth from wood piles and banners in Makham Mijann. Makham Mijann lies north of Tadrent.\n2\tTalk to Bruidis in Tadrent\tYou have collected a suitable amount of wood and cloth. You should give these materials to Bruidis in Tadrent.\n",
[4309]="70044307\n1\tDefeat Mordor siege-builders (total: 5)\030Destroy lumber piles (total: 8)\tParth Gladló is located in southern Talath Anor. You should defeat Mordor siege-builders and destroy lumber piles at Parth Gladló.\n2\tSpeak with Tolwin\tSpeak with Tolwin.\n",
[4310]="70020F01\n1\tRecoge las órdenes de los desertores (total: 5)\tLos oficiales dunlendinos pueden encontrarse en Lhe Lhechu, al sudoeste de Echad Dagoras. Deberías recoger documentos de los oficiales dunlendinos en Fordirith y averiguar más sobre el motivo de su presencia en las fronteras del antiguo Reino del Norte.\n2\tLleva las órdenes de los dunlendinos a Dagoras\tDagoras se encuentra en Echad Dagoras, al nordeste de Lhe Lhechu. Deberías entregar a Dagoras las órdenes que has encontrado.\n",
[4311]="700493F3\n1\tReturn to the spot where Aiglos lies\tAiglos can be found in Dor Amarth. You should travel back to Aiglos to assess the situation.\n2\tDefeat the Order of the Eye devoted (total: 6)\tThose devoted to the Order of the Eye can be found around Aiglos. You should defeat them to stand any chance of retrieving the spear.\n3\tConfront a devoted\tA wounded devoted can be found near Aiglos. You should confront the wounded devoted from the Order of the Eye.\n4\tConfront the wounded devoted\tA wounded devoted can be found near Aiglos. You should confront the wounded devoted from the Order of the Eye.\n5\tDefeat the Order of the Eye devoted (total: 4)\tThose devoted to the Order of the Eye can be found around Aiglos. You should defeat them if you stand any chance of retrieving the spear.\n6\tHabla con Legolas.\tLegolas can be found near Aiglos in Dor Amarth. You should speak with Legolas.\n",
[4312]="700262D4\n1\tPrueba cervezas siniestras antes de que se acabe el tiempo (total: 6)\tLas cervezas siniestras pueden encontrarse por todo el Laberinto de Setos, esperando a ser bebidas. Debes probarlas....... ¡pero ten cuidado! Te desorientarán durante tu recorrido. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tHabla con Birdie Espinajo\tBirdie Espinajo se encuentra fuera del Laberinto de Setos. Debes hablar con Birdie Espinajo y contarle tu éxito al probar las cervezas siniestras del laberinto.\n",
[4313]="7001BE11\n1\tDerrota a trolls de las nieves destripadores (total: 12)\tLos trolls de las nieves pueden encontrarse en lo profundo de Sarnúr, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin, a través de las ruinas de Orodost. Snár te ha pedido que derrotes a los trolls de las nieves que habitan las antiguas ruinas enanas.\n2\tHabla con Snár en la Mansión de Thorin\tSnár está en la Mansión de Thorin, al norte de Orodost, justo fuera del Cuartel de la Piedra Azul. Debes regresar con Snár con noticias de tu éxito contra los trolls de las nieves.\n",
[4314]="70037081\n1\tDefeat goblin-skirmishers near Oserley\tYou should defeat the goblin-skirmishers who scout the plains near Oserley.\n2\tDefeat goblin-skirmishers near Oserley (total: 8)\tGoblin-skirmishers can be found in the fields west of Oserley. You should defeat the goblin-skirmishers harassing Oserley.\n",
[4315]="7003EA79\n1\tDerrota murciélagos en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls (total: 6)\tHay murciélagos en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls. Mientras estés en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls, deberías acabar con el espionaje de los murciélagos del Enemigo en la región.\n",
[4316]="7004E83F\n1\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain. You encountered a messenger of Erebor who urged you to speak to the King under the Mountain at once.\n2\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have arrived at Erebor and found a number of dwarves pacing restlessly before the King under the Mountain. You should speak to King Thorin III at once.\n3\tListen to King Thorin III speak of Karazgar\030Listen to King Thorin III speak of Vethúg Wintermind\tKing Thorin III has asked you to listen to him speak on matters concerning Karazgar and Vethúg Wintermind.\n4\tListen to King Thorin III speak of Nori\tKing Thorin III has asked you to listen to him speak on matters concerning Nori, the Keeper of the Coffers.\n5\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have learned of the matters troubling King Thorin III and should now heed the will of the King under the Mountain.\n6\tRestless dwarves can be found before the throne of the King under the Mountain. King Thorin III Stonehelm has grown weary of rising tensions among the Dwarves of Erebor, and has asked you to listen to the grievances of his people that he might better understand them.\t\n7\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have heard the grievances of the dwarves of Erebor, and you should now return to King Thorin III.\n8\tDeliver Nori's missive to Dori in the Hall Under the Mountain\tDori can be found in the Hall under the Mountain. King Thorin III has asked you to deliver the missive Nori left behind before he departed Erebor to Dori in the Hall under the Mountain.\n",
[4317]="7004327B\n1\tTalk to Baranor in Arnach\tBaranor can be found in Arnach, which can be reached by travelling east across the Erui at the Crossings or by use of the bridge near the beacon Minlos. Lady Terenis has asked you to travel east to Arnach and aid the guards there in keeping the people of Lossarnach from harm.\n",
[4318]="70066B49\n1\tDiscover Bel Tâkhmar\tDestroying their weapons barrels at Bel Tâkhmar may prevent them from causing further trouble.\n2\tDestroy weapons barrels at Bel Tâkhmar (total: 6)\tDestroying their weapons barrels at Bel Tâkhmar may prevent them from causing further trouble.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have destroyed many weapons barrels at Bel Tâkhmar.\n",
[4319]="70072EC4\n1\tHabla con Sorkamâl la Tolerante\tSorkamâl la Tolerante ha descubierto una forma de liberar sus mentes y sacarlos. Usa su pergamino para liberar sus mentes y recoger los suministros necesarios para el esfuerzo de guerra de Mizâdi. Habla con Sorkamâl para que te dé el pergamino.\n2\tUsa Libera la mente en los sirvientes poseídos (total: 5)\030Reúne provisiones (total: 8)\tBusca a los sirvientes poseídos. Libéralos del control y reúne suministros adicionales por toda el área para el esfuerzo de guerra.\n3\tDerrota a los refuerzos de los Orcos antiguos cerca de la entrada\tBusca y derrota a los Orcos antiguos cerca de la entrada.\n4\tDerrota a Daithúch el Bebedor de Heridas y sus secuaces\tDerrota a Daithúch el Bebedor de Heridas y sus secuaces para escapar.\n",
[4320]="70040B0C\n1\tFight the Corsair overseer\030Reclaim crates (total: 8)\tThe Corsairs can be found along the River Ringló, north-west of Tadrent. Find and defeat the overseer of the Corsair shipping operation. Steal back crates for the merchants of Tadrent.\n2\tSpeak with Bruidis\tBruidis is in the town of Tadrent. You should speak with Bruidis and inform her that you successfully stopped the Corsair shipping operation.\n",
})
